   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Language and Professional Training  JPO/SARC/BBE/NE/JPD - Language and Professional Training</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Spr&#xe5;kutbildning&amp;Fackutbildning inkl. l&#xf6;n, resor, kost och logi JPO/SARCBBENEJPD</narrative>
